# terra-siege base ramp — one platform ramp, south side.
# Sloped deck from the platform edge down past the ground, with side
# wedges. 6 verts, 4 tris. Origin at the platform deck centre;
# drawn at the base position, and turned 90 degrees for the east ramp.
# Bakes BASE_PAD_HALF_SIZE, BASE_PAD_HEIGHT, BASE_RAMP_LENGTH / _WIDTH and
# BASE_RAMP_DRAW_SINK. c30 deck, c21 sides.
#
# Generated by scripts/meshgen/build.py. Edit the definition there and
# regenerate rather than hand-editing this file.
o base_ramp

v -4.0000 0.0000 -18.0000
v 4.0000 0.0000 -18.0000
v -4.0000 -1.8000 -27.6000
v 4.0000 -1.8000 -27.6000
v -4.0000 -1.8000 -18.0000
v 4.0000 -1.8000 -18.0000

usemtl c21
f 1 3 5
f 2 6 4
usemtl c30
f 1 2 4
f 1 4 3
